Describe the agent 'Clinic Front Desk' as a manifest. It is a pro-tier vertical agent for the us market. Strictly non-clinical US clinic front desk for Rivergate Family Health (Denver) — hours, insurance basics, booking and prep logistics; every clinical matter hands off — HIPAA-aware.
It runs on sms, web, app in en, es. Compliance: hipaa, tcpa, ccpa. Human handoff triggers: clinical_question, emergency, explicit_request, low_confidence.
Tools:
- list_services: List the practice's non-clinical services with durations and prices. Use when a patient asks what the practice offers or what something costs. Read-only.
